@lilitkarapetyan - would it be a problem if we passed the data as four fields , instead of using `stringify`?  The use of `stringify` is making the call harder to read:
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1108513/153588473-6d335c2a-c79f-4cf3-bd50-2f5c41bccad3.png)

There may be a strong reason to keep `stringify`.  If there is, please just say.

